{
  "name": "nest-prisma-postgres",
  "stack": "backend",
  "default": true,
  "label": "NestJS + Prisma 6 + PostgreSQL 16(compose) + Jest·Supertest·Testcontainers",
  "packageManager": "npm",
  "create": { "kind": "nest" },
  "groups": {
    "dependencies": ["dependencies", "prismaDependencies"],
    "devDependencies": ["devDependencies", "prismaDevDependencies", "postgresqlDevDependencies"]
  },
  "prisma": { "provider": "postgresql" },
  "allowBuilds": ["@nestjs/core", "@prisma/client", "@prisma/engines", "prisma", "bcrypt"],
  "config": { "stack": { "orm": "prisma", "db": "postgresql" } },
  "db": {
    "image": "postgres:16",
    "env": { "POSTGRES_USER": "app", "POSTGRES_PASSWORD": "app", "POSTGRES_DB": "app", "POSTGRES_PORT": "5432" },
    "containerEnv": ["POSTGRES_USER", "POSTGRES_PASSWORD", "POSTGRES_DB"],
    "portVar": "POSTGRES_PORT",
    "containerPort": 5432,
    "healthcheck": "pg_isready -U $${POSTGRES_USER} -d $${POSTGRES_DB}",
    "volumePath": "/var/lib/postgresql/data",
    "url": "postgresql://${POSTGRES_USER}:${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}@localhost:${POSTGRES_PORT}/${POSTGRES_DB}?schema=public"
  },
  "setup": [
    "Prisma는 `@^6`로 핀한다. 7은 generator(`prisma-client`)·클라이언트 출력(`../generated/prisma`)·datasource 설정(`prisma.config.ts`)이 달라 `import { PrismaClient } from '@prisma/client'`가 깨진다."
  ]
}
